\end{split}
\] L’approximation est valide : \(\frac{6.2 \cdot 10^{-8}}{0.0476} \cdot 100\% \approx 0\% &lt; 5\%\) \[
\begin{split}
|\ce{H3O}^{+}|_{total} &= 0.0476\ M + \cancel{6.2 \cdot 10^{-8}} \quad \text{(négligeable)} \\
&= 0.0476\ M \\
pH &= - \log |\ce{H3O}^{+}| = - \log 0.0476 = 1.32
